ritarian style government actually  works right we can take away people's  personal freedoms and stuff but isn't  that better than dying isn't that better  than millions of people dying and  honestly it kind of worked in the  beginning i think a lot of people were  like you know china's pretty brutal but  at the same time you know look at how  they've dealt with this a lot of people  didn't die in comparison to the rest of  the world that's i guess if you believe  the numbers right i mean there's also a  question as to yeah but of course  yeah i'm always speaking uh like a  normal reader yes looking at the news  right right um let's pretend like you  believe the numbers so  then people are in a position to say you  know what this other style of governance  maybe they're not going to jump on and  be like yeah china is the future china's  the way but they'll look at it and say  you know what maybe this kind of  reporting that i see about china is not  really accurate right  and what happens is unfortunately when  you get new variants when you get  something that spreads so crazy like  omicron and then the rest of the world  has found out ways to deal with it  whether it be mrna vaccinations on  things that have been proven to work  china didn't adopt those things out of  face to save face to say that we have  our own homegrown method we have our own  vaccine which is not very effective by  the way again  we have our own lockdown strategies and  we've already put in the work so we  don't really have to suffer through this  anymore while you guys still have to and  the rest of the world's kind of saying  what do you mean like it's not number  one it's not as the the new variant's  not as bad number two a lot of our  population is vaccinated and number  three we have an actual dynamic approach  on how to deal with it that doesn't  necessarily restrict people's personal  freedoms  and china says no no blinders on we have  zero coved we have zero code we have  zero covered and that can't be proven  wrong because in the top down leadership  in china there is no there is no saying  that the government is wrong about their  strategy they have to be right and see  it through  and we're seeing where xi jinping is  currently trying to get into his third  term he has to make sure  that his policies  not only worked but nobody has any sort  of dissent or disapproval with them  right so we're looking at a situation  now where zero kovid is either going to  change and rebrand to the to save leader  leadership face or is going to continue  down this very draconian route  we've been speaking with matthew ty  known online as laowai 86 or sea milk  matthew's so great speaking to you and  really appreciate your insights  thank you so much david
 

